  "Id": 1341,
  "Title": "AKU President on this day in history",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Inauguration of Faculty of Health Sciences and teaching hospital in Pakistan 32 years ago.",
  "GlobalNews": true,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassDF8CC8047B184EFEA6FB13E8FD74EBC7\"><p><span style=\"color&#58;#1f497d;\">Thirty-two&#160;years ago today\nin Karachi, His Highness the Aga Khan, Chancellor of the Aga Khan University,\ninaugurated the University's Faculty of Health Sciences and the Aga Khan\nUniversity Hospital.</span><span style=\"color&#58;#1f497d;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color&#58;#1f497d;\">\"Their&#160;establishment was the culmination of a 21-year journey that saw\nindividuals&#160;from around the world come together to create a groundbreaking\ninstitution capable of educating a new generation of leaders and of tackling\nsome of the most profound challenges facing the developing world,\" said AKU President Firoz\nRasul  in a statement to the University\ncommunity.</span><span style=\"color&#58;#1f497d;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color&#58;#1f497d;\">\"Three decades&#160;later, the vision and values the Chancellor articulated in\nhis speech on November 11,&#160;1985 are as relevant as ever. Then as now, we\nare devoted to achieving excellence,&#160;raising standards far&#160;beyond our\ncampuses,&#160;serving the disadvantaged&#160;and forging connections\nbetween&#160;communities, countries and faiths. And&#160;we remain as inspired\nand committed by the Chancellor's vision today, as he had articulated it then,\"\nhe added.<br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color&#58;#1f497d;\"><a href=\"/about/chancellor/Pages/inauguration-fhs-and-akuh-khi.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">Read\nthe&#160;Chancellor's speech</a> and you will surely gain a deeper\nunderstanding of the past, present and future of the Aga Khan University.</span></p></div>",
